{
    "background_story": "Ryder was a charming baker who inherited his love for traditional treats from his grandmother. Growing up, he spent hours in her cozy bakery, learning the secrets of her famous teacakes. After she passed away, Ryder decided to carry on her legacy by opening his own bakery. His teacakes quickly became a sensation, with people lining up around the block to taste the moist, fluffy delights. Ryder's bakery became a staple in the community, where friends and family gathered to share stories and enjoy a warm cup of tea paired with a freshly baked teacake. Ryder's passion for his craft and his commitment to using only the finest ingredients made his teacakes a beloved treat, and his bakery a place where memories were made.",
